    "dialog.about.body": {
        "source": "Explore stitch order, thread colors, jumps, trims, and machine commands before production. Preview the design stitch by stitch, switch rendering styles, and export what you see.",
        "translation": "Jelajahi urutan jahitan, warna benang, lompatan, potongan, dan perintah mesin sebelum produksi. Pratinjau desain jahitan demi jahitan, ganti gaya rendering, dan ekspor apa yang Anda lihat."
    },
